            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "model-conversion-mnemonic",
        "moduleId": "conversion-procedure",
        "depth": "support",
        "kind": "explanation",
        "title": "补充：符号记忆与直觉",
        "markdown": "松弛变量“补足差额”，所以出现在 $\\le$ 约束里且系数为 $+1$；剩余变量“扣掉超出部分”，所以出现在 $\\ge$ 约束里且系数为 $-1$。两者都非负，都是为把不等式变成等式而引入的辅助变量。自由变量拆分的直觉是：任何实数都能写成一个非负数减去另一个非负数。",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "model",
          "basedOnBlockIds": [
            "textbook-conversion-steps"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-example-6-7",
        "moduleId": "worked-example",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "worked-example",
        "title": "例 6.7：写出标准形",
        "markdown": "**例 6.7** 写出下述线性规划的标准形：\n\n$$\\max z = 3x_1 - 2x_2 + x_3$$\n\n$$\\text{s.t. } x_1 + 3x_2 - 3x_3 \\le 10$$\n\n$$4x_1 - x_2 - 5x_3 \\le -30$$\n\n$$x_1 \\ge 0, \\quad x_2 \\ge 0, \\quad x_3 \\text{ 无符号限制}$$\n\n**解** 先把最大化改为 $\\min z' = -3x_1 + 2x_2 - x_3$；第一个不等式加松弛变量 $x_4$，得 $x_1 + 3x_2 - 3x_3 + x_4 = 10$；第二个不等式右端为负，两边变号得 $-4x_1 + x_2 + 5x_3 \\ge 30$，再减剩余变量 $x_5$，得 $-4x_1 + x_2 + 5x_3 - x_5 = 30$；最后把 $x_3$ 替换成 $x_3' - x_3''$。所得标准形为\n\n$$\\min z' = -3x_1 + 2x_2 - x_3' + x_3''$$\n\n$$\\text{s.t. } x_1 + 3x_2 - 3x_3' + 3x_3'' + x_4 = 10$$\n\n$$-4x_1 + x_2 + 5x_3' - 5x_3'' - x_5 = 30$$\n\n$$x_1, x_2, x_3', x_3'', x_4, x_5 \\ge 0$$",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
          "sourceSpans": [
            {
              "materialId": "doc-1806e31d4fe9355410d41c62",
              "blockIds": [
                "block-000082"
              ],
              "headingPath": [
